      "content": "so you're saying it's basically just a clash of personal beliefs? but if the goal of a company is to make sure everyone feels safe and respected, isn't it objectively better to prioritize the group that feels excluded rather than catering to the \"traditional\" views of people who might just be uncomfortable with change? it feels like one side is about fundamental human respect and the other is just about personal preference or politics.",
